WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue {
    color: white;
    background-color: #383943A3;
}

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.284
Honestly?

00:00:01.285 --> 00:00:02.097
Go.

00:00:02.237 --> 00:00:06.334
You've been grinding toward this for months – one
night out isn't going to undo that.

00:00:06.334 --> 00:00:09.898
Just be sensible about it, eat something before you
go, don't make it a late one.

00:00:10.026 --> 00:00:10.757
You'll be fine.

00:00:10.757 --> 00:00:11.931
Blue top, by the way.